m Liquid</td><td>Paper Rex</td><td class=\"kb-dim\">— 尚未成立</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"kb-y\">2024 启点赛</td><td>Sentinels</td><td>Karmine Corp</td><td>Gen.G</td><td>EDward Gaming</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"kb-y\">2024 第一赛段</td><td>100 Thieves</td><td>Fnatic</td><td>Paper Rex</td><td>EDward Gaming</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"kb-y\">2024 第二赛段</td><td>Leviatán</td><td>Fnatic</td><td>Gen.G</td><td>EDward Gaming</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"kb-y\">2025 启点赛</td><td>G2 Esports</td><td>Team Vitality</td><td>DRX</td><td>EDward Gaming</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"kb-y\">2025 第一赛段</td><td>G2 Esports</td><td>Fnatic</td><td>Rex Regum Qeon</td><td>XLG Esports</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"kb-y\">2025 第二赛段</td><td>G2 Esports</td><td>Team Liquid</td><td>Paper Rex</td><td>Bilibili Gaming</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"kb-y\">2026 第一赛段</td><td>G2 Esports</td><td>Team Heretics</td><td>Paper Rex</td><td>EDward Gaming</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <h3 class=\"kb-h3\">晋升赛 Ascension 晋级战队</h3>\n    <div class=\"kb-tbl-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"kb-tbl\">\n        <thead><tr><th>赛季</th><th>美洲</th><th>EMEA</th><th>太平洋</th><th>CN</th></tr></thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td class=\"kb-y\">2023</td><td>The Guard → G2 继承</td><td>Gentle Mates</td><td>Bleed → BOOM 递补</td><td>DRG</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"kb-y\">2024</td><td>2GAME Esports</td><td>Apeks</td><td>Sin Prisa → NS RedForce</td><td>XLG Esports</td></tr>\n          <tr><td class=\"kb-y\">2025</td><td>ENVY</td><td>PCIFIC、ULF</td><td>NS RedForce*、SLT Seongnam</td><td>DRG*</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"kb-small kb-dim\"><sup>*</sup> 表示该队伍通过晋升赛成功捍卫其国际联赛席位，而非新晋升。</p>\n  \n  </section>",
 "_kbRegions": "\n  <section class=\"kb-section\" id=\"kb-regions\">\n    <div class=\"kb-sec-head\">\n      <span class=\"kb-sec-num\">05</span>\n      <h2>四大赛区与参赛战队</h2>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"kb-sec-desc\">2026 赛季国际联赛 48 支队伍构成</p>\n    \n    <div class=\"kb-grid kb-g2\">\n      \n        <div class=\"kb-region\">\n          <div class=\"kb-region-head kb-rh-am\">\n            <span class=\"kb-tag a\">Americas</span>\n            <span class=\"kb-region-title\">VCT 美洲联赛</span>\n            <span class=\"kb-region-loc\">洛杉矶 · Riot Games Arena</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"kb-region-body\">\n            <div class=\"kb-kv\"><span class=\"kv-k\">覆盖范围</span><span class=\"kv-v\">北美、拉丁美洲、巴西</span></div>\n            <div class=\"kb-kv\"><span class=\"kv-k\">联赛标志</span><span class=\"kv-v\">已安放、意图启动的爆能器</span></div>\n            <div class=\"kb-kv\"><span class=\"kv-k\">2026 队伍</span><span class=\"kv-v\"><span class=\"kb-tag \">100 Thieves</span><span class=\"kb-tag \">Cloud9</span><span class=\"kb-tag \">Evil Geniuses</span><span class=\"kb-tag \">FURIA</span><span class=\"kb-tag \">G2 Esports</span><span class=\"kb-tag \">KRÜ</span><span class=\"kb-tag \">Leviatán</span><span class=\"kb-tag \">LOUD</span><span class=\"kb-tag \">MIBR</span><span class=\"kb-tag \">NRG</span><span class=\"kb-tag \">Sentinels</span><span class=\"kb-tag \">ENVY(晋升)</span></span></div>\n            <div class=\"kb-kv\"><span class=\"kv-k\">代表战队</span><span class=\"kv-v\">NRG（2025 世界冠军）、LOUD（2022 世界冠军）、Evil Geniuses（2023 世界冠军）、Sentinels（2 座大师赛冠军）、Leviatán（2026 伦敦大师赛冠军）、G2 Esports（美洲赛区四连冠）</span></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      \n        <div class=\"kb-region\">\n          <div class=\"kb-region-head kb-rh-em\">\n            <span class=\"kb-tag b\">EMEA</span>\n            <span class=\"kb-region-title\">VCT EMEA 联赛</span>\n            <span class=\"kb-region-loc\">德国 · 柏林</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"kb-region-body\">\n            <d